# fastly_package_hash (Data Source)

Use this data source to generate a SHA512 hash of all files (in sorted order) within a Wasm deployment package.

## Example Usage

```terraform
data "fastly_package_hash" "example" {
  filename = "./path/to/package.tar.gz"
}

resource "fastly_service_compute_auto" "example" {
  name          = "example"
  force_destroy = true

  package {
    filename         = "./path/to/package.tar.gz"
    source_code_hash = data.fastly_package_hash.example.hash
  }
}
```

